<%- include('partials/header') %>

<article class="page">
  <h1>Welcome to Puz-Zoo</h1>

  <section class="story-box">
    <p class="story-text">
      The zoo has closed for the night, and you are still inside. The gates are locked and
      the lights are off. The zookeeper hid the way out, and the animals will only help
      if you solve their puzzles.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p>Solve every puzzle to escape. Wrong answers are fine, so keep trying.</p>

  <p><a class="button" href="/play/<%= startPath %>">Start</a></p>
</article>

